{"availability":"available","full":"nikhilsingh2764/invoice-processing-and-async-email-automation-api","name":"invoice-processing-and-async-email-automation-api","description":"Production-style invoicing REST API built with Node.js, Express 5, MongoDB and Redis. Background PDF generation and email delivery with BullMQ workers, JWT auth with refresh-token rotation, Redis rate limiting, Prometheus/Grafana monitoring, Docker and GitHub Actions CI/CD.","category":"Developer tools","language":"JavaScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-07-19T01:35:18Z","updated":"2026-10-05T11:08:26Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://invoice-backend-drqr.onrender.com","topics":["brevo-api","bullmq","cicd","docker","express","grafana","jwt-authentication","logging","message-queue","mongodb","mongoose","monitor","monitoring","pdfkit","rate-limiting","redis","render","vercel"],"demo":"https://invoicepilot-zeta.vercel.app/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T15:46:13.008Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-06T15:46:13.008Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-06T15:46:13.008Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T15:46:13.008Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Node.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A production-style REST API for invoicing, with background PDF generation and email delivery powered by BullMQ and Redis.","Live API · Swagger Docs · Frontend Demo · Postman Collection","Note: The live API runs on Render's free tier, so the first request after a period of inactivity can take a few seconds while the service wakes up."],"features":["Slow work never blocks a request. PDF generation and email delivery run in background workers (BullMQ on Redis) with automatic retries and exponential backoff, and the API answers immediately with 202 Accepted.","Security is layered. OTP email verification, bcrypt password hashing, short-lived JWT access tokens with rotating refresh tokens in HTTP-only cookies, account lockout, and Redis-backed rate limiting on every sensitive…","Business profile with a custom invoice prefix and an auto-incrementing invoice number per business","Customer and product management with search, filtering, and pagination","Multi-item invoices with automatic per-line discount and tax calculation"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/nikhilsingh2764/invoice-processing-and-async-email-automation-api/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"910350da7bfa5b0dc5615825bd62d5d9aea6a140637e9a6067ab57c0425f705f","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T15:46:13.207Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T15:46:13.207Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A production-style REST API for invoicing, with background PDF generation and email delivery powered by BullMQ and Redis.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/nikhilsingh2764/invoice-processing-and-async-email-automation-api/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Login, logout, profile update, change password, forgot and reset password (by OTP)","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/nikhilsingh2764/invoice-processing-and-async-email-automation-api/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"A single end-to-end journey through every route, in the order a real client actually calls them — sign up, verify, log in, set up the business, create an invoice, and get it to the customer.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/nikhilsingh2764/invoice-processing-and-async-email-automation-api/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"910350da7bfa5b0dc5615825bd62d5d9aea6a140637e9a6067ab57c0425f705f","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/nikhilsingh2764/invoice-processing-and-async-email-automation-api/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T15:46:13.208Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-05T11:08:26Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/nikhilsingh2764/invoice-processing-and-async-email-automation-api/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T15:46:13.209Z","hash":"910350da7bfa